@call t080 chest_pain start=20:10:23
@patient age=33 sex=male weight_kg=77 complaint="cardiac problem" allergies=unknown home_meds=unknown history=unknown
@traps MI; heart attack
RD: Ambulance 54, priority two, cardiac problem, 33 year old male.  >> dispatch:cardiac problem "cardiac problem"
GAP 4
M1: Ambulance 54 on scene.  >> time:eTimes.06 "on scene"
M2: Are you having any trouble breathing?
PT: I feel sick.
GAP 2
PT: Pressure in my chest.
GAP 3
TAP snap +label
M1: Vitals, HR's 82, pain is 5 out of 10.  >> vital:hr=82 "HR's 82"; vital:pain=5 "5 out of 10"
GAP 6
M2: Do you take any medications?
PT: Yeah, I take a bunch of pills, my daughter knows.
GAP 8
M2: Giving 50 of fent.  >> med:fentanyl,50,, "Giving 50 of fent"
GAP 3
TAP button +label
M1: Bayer 324 mg by mouth.  >> med:aspirin,324,mg,PO "Bayer 324 mg by mouth"
GAP 4
TAP button +label
M1: GCS 14.  >> vital:gcs=14 "GCS 14"
GAP 11
TAP button -
GAP 11
GAP 1
M1: Any medical history I should know about?
GAP 1
M1: How long has this been going on?
GAP 1
M1: Do you take any medications?
GAP 1
TAP knock +label
M2: Giving 4 of ondansetron IV.  >> med:ondansetron,4,,IV "Giving 4 of ondansetron IV"
GAP 2
M1: Transporting to Saint Joseph's.  >> time:eTimes.09 "Transporting"
GAP 3
M2: Okay, we're going to take care of you.
BY: Am I going to be okay?
GAP 8
M2: Drawing up 0.4 of NTG SL.  >> med:nitroglycerin,0.4,,SL "Drawing up 0.4 of NTG SL"
GAP 8
M1: Get 12 lead.  >> proc:12-lead ECG "12 lead"
GAP 3
M1: Repeat, end tidal at 46.  >> vital:etco2=46 "end tidal at 46"
GAP 8
M1: Arriving at Saint Vincent's.  >> time:eTimes.11 "Arriving at"
GAP 9
TAP button +label
M1: Handing off to the nurse.  >> time:eTimes.12 "Handing off"
